  "summary": "Malicious code in noblox-asset.js (npm)",
  "details": "The postinstall hook (postinstall.mjs) is an obfuscated Windows dropper. It performs extensive virtual-machine and analysis-environment detection (VirtualBox/VMware/Parallels/QEMU driver and registry checks, MAC-address prefixes, boot-time and debugger/process checks) and, if the environment is deemed real, downloads a binary from hxxps://trlxgames[.]netlify[.]app/TRLX[.]exe to the system temp directory and executes it. The package is a clone of the legitimate noblox.js Roblox API wrapper with this malicious install-time payload injected.",
